:: Photo Examine
<<effects>><<loadNPC 1 "pubfame_model">><<generateyv3>><<generatev4>>

<<if !$photo.desk>>
	<<set $photo.desk to true>>
	당신은 책상 옆으로 다가가 니키를 슬쩍 바라본다. 니키가 당신에게 고개를 끄덕인다. "아무것도 건드리지 않기만 하면 돼요."
	<br><br>
<</if>>
당신은 책상 뒤로 넘어가 벽에 걸린 사진들을 살펴본다. <<group>> 사진 몇 장이 우아한 자세를 취한 채 이쪽을 응시하고 있다. 사진들은 손상되지 않도록 유리 덮개가 있는 나무 액자 안에 보관되어 있다.
<br><br>

속옷 차림으로 머리 위로 팔을 뻗고 있는 <<person3>><<person>>【이가】 있다. 고딕
<<if $pronoun is "m" and $rng gte 11 or $pronoun is "f" and $rng lte 10>>
	suit, sitting beside a suitcase.
<<else>>
	gown, sitting beside a parasol.
<</if>>
그리고 뒷짐을 지고 <<npcRevealText $NPCList[1] "lower">> 나체의 <<person2>><<person>>【이가】 있다.
<br><br>

당신은 더 가까이 다가간다. <<person>>【은는】 눈에 띄게 불편해 보이고,
<<if $pubfame.niki.hair is "no">>
	<<hes>> 완전히 대머리다.
<<else>>
	<<his>> 머리는 뚜렷한 $pubfame.niki.hair이다.
<</if>>
<span class="gold">미키의 연락처를 찾았다.</span>
<br><br>

<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
<<link [[훔친다|Photo Examine Steal]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<br>
<<link [[달라고 부탁한다|Photo Examine Ask]]>><</link>>
<br><br>

<<link [[돌아간다|Photo]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Photo Examine Steal
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess>>
	당신은 조용히 벽에서 액자를 떼어낸 후, 유리 덮개를 밀어 연다. 사진을 꺼내고, 덮개를 다시 닫은 다음 액자를 벽에 다시 건다.
	<br><br>

	니키가 갑자기 의자를 돌려 당신과 빈 액자를 살펴본다. <<He>>【은는】 얼굴을 찌푸리고 혀를 찬다. "분명 저기 하나 있었는데."
	<br><br>

	With a sigh, <<he>> turns back to <<his>> desk and rummages through a cabinet. "<span class="green">Must've taken it out and forgot to replace it.</span> Shame, <span class="gold">that was the last one <<person2>><<he>> did</span>." <<person1>><<He>> pulls a new photo out and walks to the frame. <<He>> slides it in, smooths the edge with a thumb, then nods and sits back down.
	<br><br>

	<<pubfameComplete "niki">>
	<<link [[뒤로|Photo]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	당신은 벽에서 액자를 떼어내려 한다. <span class="red">"그거 만지지 마요."</span> 니키가 말한다. 니키가 당신을 향해 몸을 돌리자 당신은 손을 뗀다.
	<br><br>

	<<He>>【은는】 당신과 액자를 번갈아 보더니, <<his>> 주머니에서 천을 꺼내 액자를 닦는다. "덮개에 지문이 묻으면 안 되죠." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. 몇 초 후, <<he>>【은는】 다시 자리에 앉는다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[달라고 요청한다|Photo Examine Ask]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[뒤로|Photo]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Photo Examine Ask
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<if !$pubfame.niki.money>>
	<<set $pubfame.niki.money to random(12,25)*10000>>
<</if>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	당신은 니키의 어깨를 두드리고, <<he>>【은는】 당신을 보기 위해 몸을 돌린다. "실례합니다." 당신이 묻는다, "이 사진을 가질 수 있을까요?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You wait until Niki finishes with the papers on <<his>> desk, then gesture to the frame. "Excuse me, Niki. Would you be willing to part with this photo?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You tap Niki on the shoulder, then lower your hand at once when <<he>> turns. "Excuse me," you ask, "could I have this photo? I won't make trouble."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You clear your throat, and Niki swivels around to see you. "I'd be willing to take this off your hands," you say, jerking your thumb at the photo.<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">> "It doesn't suit the wall anyway."<</if>>
<<else>>
	당신은 헛기침을 하고, 니키는 당신을 보기 위해 몸을 돌린다. "이거 파는 건가요?" 당신은 사진을 가리키며 묻는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Niki rolls closer to the photo and examines it for a moment, as if weighing your request against the neatness of the wall. "<<printprice $pubfame.niki.money "red">>. I'm fond of this one. The colours pair well with the rest of the wall.<<if ["red","blue","purple"].includes($pubfame.niki.hair)>> Especially the splash of $pubfame.niki.hair.<</if>> And <span class="gold">it's the last one <<person2>><<he>> did</span>."
<br><br>

<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price($pubfame.niki.money) : $pubfame.niki.money)>>
	<<link [["산다 (" + _printmoney + ")"|Photo Examine Buy]]>><<money `-$pubfame.niki.money`>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="purple">돈이 부족합니다.</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[다른 지불 수단에 대해 묻는다|Photo Examine Barter]]>><</link>>
<br><br>

<<link [[뒤로|Photo]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Photo Examine Buy
<<effects>><<person1>>

You give Niki the money, and <<he>> counts it before taking the frame off the wall. <<He>> slides open the cover with careful fingers and hands the photo to you. "The case will be extra. This wood is expensive."
<br><br>

Not waiting for an answer, <<he>> slides a new photo in the frame and hangs it back up on the wall. <<He>> steps back, tilts <<his>> head, then adjusts the frame by a finger's width before nodding and sitting back down.
<br><br>

<<pubfameComplete "niki">>

<<link [[뒤로|Photo]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Photo Examine Barter
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"혹시 다른 방법으로 가질 수는 없을까요?" 당신은 묻는다. "좀 더... 저렴한 방법으로요?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Would you consider some other kind of payment?" you ask. "Something that still leaves your wall looking proper."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Is there any other way I could have it?" you ask. "A less... expensive way? I'll do what I can."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You cross your arms. "Any way I could get it without paying out the nose?"<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">> You glance over the frame. "It isn't worth that much."<</if>>
<<else>>
	"혹시 다른 걸로 대신 받아주실 수 있나요?" 당신은 묻는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

니키는 잠시 당신을 빤히 쳐다본다. <<He>>【은는】 입에 하얀 막대기를 물고 생각에 잠긴 듯 움직인다. "방법이 하나 있긴 하죠. 당신 사진으로 이 사진을 대체할 수 있다면, 벽에 빈자리가 생기지 않을 테니까요. 물론, <span class="lewd">알몸이 되어야 해요</span>. 여전히 돈은 드리겠지만, 사진 값을 상쇄하기 위해 금액은 줄어들 거예요."
<br><br>

<<if $photo.model is 1>>
	<<He>>【은는】 턱을 톡톡 친다. "보통은 일주일에 두 번 촬영은 안 하지만, 이번엔 예외로 해드리죠."
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if ["exhibitionism","model"].includes($pubfame.target) and $pubfame.goal.includes("Lower")>>
	Modelling to lower your <<fameProse $pubfame.target>> fame sounds counterintuitive, but the photo you came for matters more. You're sure 'Mickey' will decrease your image more than this would increase it.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[수락한다 (3:00)|Photo Model]]>><<set $photo.model to 1>><<set $photo.pubfame to true>><</link>><<exhibitionist1>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Photo Examine Refuse]]>><</link>>

:: Photo Examine Refuse
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"No, thank you," you say, drawing back from the offer.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'll leave it, then," you say. "Thank you for explaining."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I understand," you say, stepping away from the wall. "No, thank you."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Forget it," you say.<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">> "Keep your precious wall."<</if>>
<<else>>
	"I'll pass," you say, stepping back from the frame.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"It's either that or payment," Niki says, shrugging. <<He>> swivels back to <<his>> desk, already treating the matter as finished.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Photo]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
